stant grounded in your company data." "ML-powered enterprise search across connected content sources." "Time-series forecasting; use SageMaker Canvas instead." "Industrial equipment anomaly detection." "Automated anomaly detection in business metrics." "Customer engagement campaigns; moving to Connect and SES." "Managed business email and calendaring." "Run containerized web apps and APIs with no infrastructure work." "Service mesh; migrate to ECS Service Connect or VPC Lattice." "Original AWS NoSQL store; use DynamoDB instead." "Immutable ledger database; migrate to Aurora PostgreSQL." "Autonomous agent for incident response and reliability work." "Browser IDE; use AWS IDE Toolkits, Kiro or CloudShell." "Platform-team templates; use CloudFormation Git sync." "Low-cost purpose-built endpoint for virtual desktops." "Document storage and collaboration; retired in 2025." "Collect, transform and transfer vehicle data to the cloud." "IoT data preparation and analysis; end of support announced." "Detect and respond to events from IoT sensors; end of support." "End-to-end equipment monitoring; closed to new customers." "Continuously collect evidence for compliance audits." "Managed Chef and Puppet; retired in 2024." "Media-optimized object origin; migrate to S3." "Legacy transcoder retired in 2025; use MediaConvert." "Cloud content-production studio; discontinued." "Managed private links between AWS VPCs and other clouds." "Secure anycast DNS resolution for hybrid estates." "Agentic security review of applications from design to deploy." "Automate evidence collection for audits and frameworks." "Original Inspector; migrate to Amazon Inspector." "Cloud robotics simulation; discontinued, migrate to AWS Batch." "Large-scale spatial simulation; end of support." "Computer vision at the edge appliance; end of support." "AR/VR scene builder; retired in 2023." "Reinforcement-learning race cars; now open source only."'/></MetadataSet></MetadataSet></WorldInfo>
